#. Tag: title
#: tricks.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modem Tricks and Hints"
msgstr "Trikovi i savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section should get the fearful started on the (not so) arcane art of "
"modem tweaking. The commands here are all Hayes AT standard, but all modems "
"are not equal, so your mileage may vary."
msgstr ""
"Ova sekcija bi trebala pomoći strašljivima da započnu sa (ne toliko) "
"kompliciranom umjetnošću prilagođavanja modema. Sve komande ovdje su Hayes "
"AT standard, ali nisu svi modemi jednaki, pa može doći do varijacija."

#. Tag: title
#: tricks.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modem Sessions"
msgstr "Sesija modema"

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A Modem session allows you to interact with the modem directly. You type "
"commands, and it will respond. To obtain a modem session, when no connection "
"is active, open the <guilabel>Configure &kppp;</guilabel> dialog, select to "
"edit a modem and then click the <guibutton>Terminal</guibutton> button on "
"the <guilabel>Modem</guilabel> tab. This will open a window for interactive "
"configuration of the modem. Try typing <userinput><command>ATZ</command></"
"userinput> (which resets your modem) Your should get an OK response. Use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Close</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> to end the session."
msgstr ""
"Sesija modema Vam omogućava direktnu interakciju sa modemom. Vi unosite "
"komande, on odgovara.  Da biste pokrenuli sesiju dok niste konektovani, "
"otvorite dijalog <guilabel>Konfiguracije &kppp;</guilabel>, odaberite "
"uređivanje modema i pritisnite dugme <guibutton>Terminal</guibutton> na "
"kartici <guilabel>Modem</guilabel>. Ovo će otvoriti prozor za interaktivnu "
"konfiguraciju modema. Pokušajte unijeti <userinput><command>ATZ</command></"
"userinput>  komandu (koja ponovo postavlja Vaš modem). Trebali bi dobiti "
"odgovor OK. Koristite <menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Zatvori</guimenuitem></menuchoice> da završite sesiju."

#. Tag: title
#: tricks.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modem Profiles"
msgstr "Profili modema"

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One reason you might want to send the modem commands directly is if you have "
"a set of modem configurations you want to keep, and not have to specify for "
"every connection. A good way to do that is via modem profiles. Modems can "
"have several stored profiles numbered 0,1,... <command>AT&amp;V</command> "
"can be used to view them all. The default profile is usually 0 (this can be "
"changed via <command>AT&amp;Y</command>.) The profile currently in use is "
"called the <quote>active</quote> profile."
msgstr ""
"Jedan od razloga zašto bi ste htjeli direktno poslati komande modemu je "
"ukoliko postoje postavke modema koje želite zadržati, a ne želite ih "
"specificirati prilikom svakog povezivanja. Dobar način za to je putem "
"profila modema. Modem može imati nekoliko sačuvanih profila numerisanih sa "
"0, 1,.... Komandom <command>AT&amp;V</command> ih možete sve pregledati. "
"Zadani profil je obično 0 (ovo može biti promijenjeno komandom  "
"<command>AT&amp;Y</command>).  Profil koji je trenutno u upotrebi naziva se "
"<quote>activni</quote> profil."

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you change a setting, the active profile is modified. The <command>ATZ</"
"command> command will have the modem load the default profile, erasing any "
"changes you have made. To save changes, Load the profile you want to change "
"via <command>ATZ<replaceable>n</replaceable></command> (where "
"<replaceable>n</replaceable> is the profile number). Make the changes you "
"want, then save it with <command>AT&amp;W<replaceable>n</replaceable></"
"command>. To have kppp use the profile you want, change the modem "
"initialization string (<guibutton>Modem Commands</guibutton> "
"<guilabel>Initialization String</guilabel> on the <guilabel>Modem</guilabel> "
"tab). For example <command>ATZ1</command> will have the kppp reset the modem "
"and use stored profile #1."
msgstr ""
"Kada promijenite postavke, aktivni profil je modificiran.  Komanda  "
"<command>ATZ</command> će omogućiti da modem učitava zadani profiil, brišući "
"promjene koje ste Vi napravili. Da sačuvate promjene, učitajte profil koji "
"želite mijenjati komandom <command>ATZ<replaceable>n</replaceable></command> "
"(gdje je <replaceable>n</replaceable> broj profila). Napravite promjene koje "
"želite, a nakon toga ih sačucajte komandom <command>AT&amp;W<replaceable>n</"
"replaceable></command>. Da bi kppp koristio profil koji želite, promijenite "
"incijalizacijski string modema (<guibutton>Komande modema</guibutton> "
"<guilabel>Inicijalizacijski string</guilabel> na <guilabel>Modem</guilabel> "
"kartici). Na primjer, komandom <command>ATZ1</command> kppp ponovo postaviti "
"modem i koristiti sačuvani profil #1."

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want reset you modem to get back to some known starting point, use "
"<command>AT&amp;F&amp;W</command> to set the active profile to the factory "
"defaults, and store those settings as the default profile."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko želite ponovo postaviti Vaš modem da bi se vratili na neku poznatu "
"početnu tačku, koristite komandu <command>AT&amp;F&amp;W</command> da "
"postavite aktivni profil na fabričke postavke, te sačuvajte te postavke kao "
"zadani profil."

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "Examples of profile changes are in the next section"
msgstr "Primjeri promjene profila su u narednoj sekciji"

#. Tag: title
#: tricks.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting the modem to hang up"
msgstr "Dovođenje modema do prekida"

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes you may find that &kppp; has difficulties hanging up the modem. "
"This is likely the result of a mismatch between &kppp; settings and those of "
"the modem. A standard modem uses two methods to decide to hangup: <link "
"linkend=\"hangup-command-method\">Command</link>, and <link linkend=\"hangup-"
"dtr-method\"><acronym>DTR</acronym></link>. The Command method involves "
"sending an escape sequence to the modem, which puts it in command mode, then "
"issuing the hangup command (<command>ATH</command>)."
msgstr ""
"Nekada se može desiti da &kppp; ima problema sa odspajanjem od modema. To je "
"vjerovatno rezultat nesladanja &kppp; postavki i postavki modema. Standardni "
"modem koristi dvije metode u odlučivanju da se odspoji od modema: <link "
"linkend=\"hangup-command-method\">Komanda</link>, i <link linkend=\"hangup-"
"dtr-method\"><acronym>DTR</acronym></link>. Metoda komande uključuje slanje "
"izlazne sekvence modemu, koji je stavlja u komandni mod, a onda izdaje "
"komandu prekida (<command>ATH</command>)."

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Outside of &kppp;, when configuring the <application>pppd</application> "
"package manually, it's often helpful to use the command method, so that one "
"can exit a terminal session, and then start <application>pppd</application> "
"without having the modem hangup. In most other situations, the <acronym>DTR</"
"acronym> method is preferred, as it is simpler."
msgstr ""
"Van &kppp;, kada konfigurirate  <application>pppd</application> paket "
"manualno, često je od pomoći koristiti metodu komande, tako da bude moguć "
"izlaz iz terminal sesije, i onda pokrenut  <application>pppd</application> "
"bez da se modem mora odspojiti. U većini drugih situacija, preferira se "
"<acronym>DTR</acronym> metoda jer je jednostavnija."

#. Tag: title
#: tricks.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "<acronym>DTR</acronym> (<command>AT&amp;Dn</command>) method"
msgstr "<acronym>DTR</acronym> (<command>AT&amp;Dn</command>) metoda"

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <acronym>DTR</acronym> method will have the modem hangup whenever &kppp; "
"stops using the modem. If you obtain a modem session, and query the state "
"via <command>AT&amp;V</command>, and you can see among the displayed "
"settings for the active profile a <command>&amp;D0</command>, then the "
"<acronym>DTR</acronym> hangup method is disabled. To enable the "
"<acronym>DTR</acronym> method, use the <guibutton>Terminal</guibutton> "
"button to get a modem session, then:"
msgstr ""
"<acronym>DTR</acronym> metoda će učiniti da se modem odspoji kad god &kppp; "
"prestane koristiti modem. Ako koristite modem, i upitate za stanje sa "
"<command>AT&amp;V</command> komandom, i ako među prikazanim postavkama za "
"aktivni profil vidite  <command>&amp;D0</command>, onda je <acronym>DTR</"
"acronym> odspajanje od modema onemogućeno. Da omogućite <acronym>DTR</"
"acronym> metodu, koristite <guibutton>Terminal</guibutton> dugme da dobijete "
"sesiju modema, a zatim:"

#. Tag: screen
#: tricks.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><command>ATZ</command></userinput> <lineannotation># reset to "
"default profile</lineannotation>\n"
"<userinput><command>AT&amp;D2</command></userinput>  <lineannotation># Set "
"to hang up on DTR drop</lineannotation>\n"
"<userinput><command>AT&amp;W</command></userinput>  <lineannotation># Write "
"to default profile</lineannotation>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput><command>ATZ</command></userinput> <lineannotation>#postavi na "
"zadani profil</lineannotation>\n"
"<userinput><command>AT&amp;D2</command></userinput>  <lineannotation># "
"Postavi odspajanje na DTR</lineannotation>\n"
"<userinput><command>AT&amp;W</command></userinput>  <lineannotation># Pisi "
"zadanom profilu</lineannotation>"

#. Tag: title
#: tricks.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "How the <acronym>DTR</acronym> method works"
msgstr "Kako <acronym>DTR</acronym> radi"

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Whenever the Data Terminal Ready (<acronym>DTR</acronym>) line on the serial "
"line between the host computer and the modem goes high, the modem hangs up. "
"When &kppp; opens the serial port, the <acronym>DTR</acronym> line is pulled "
"low, on an external modem, you can see the <acronym>DTR</acronym> (or "
"<acronym>TR</acronym>) light come on when this happens. When the "
"<acronym>TR</acronym> light goes out (because &kppp; has closed the serial "
"port, or something worse!), the modem will hangup."
msgstr ""
"Kada god Data Terminal Ready (<acronym>DTR</acronym>) linija na serijskoj "
"liniji između kompjutera i modema poraste, modem se odspaja. Kada &kppp; "
"otvori serijski ulaz, <acronym>DTR</acronym> linija je umetnuta nisko, na "
"vanjskom modemu, možete vidjeti da se <acronym>DTR</acronym>(ili "
"<acronym>TR</acronym>) lampica upali kada se ovo desi. Kada se  <acronym>TR</"
"acronym> lampica ugasi (zbog toga sto je &kppp; zatvorio serijski ulaz, ili "
"nešto lošije!), modem će se odspojiti."

#. Tag: title
#: tricks.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command method"
msgstr "Metoda komande"

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The other way to have a modem hang up when connected (used when "
"<command>AT&amp;D<replaceable>n</replaceable></command> where "
"<replaceable>n</replaceable> is not <returnvalue>2</returnvalue>) is to have "
"the modem accept the command when a session is in progress. To have it hang "
"up properly, get a modem session, and set the guard time to a short interval "
"like so:"
msgstr ""
"Drugi način da se modem odspoji kada je konektovan(korišten u slućaju "
"<command>AT&amp;D<replaceable>n</replaceable></command> gdje <replaceable>n</"
"replaceable> nije <returnvalue>2</returnvalue>) je da modem prihvati komandu "
"dok je sesija u toku. Da bi se pravilno odspojio, uzmite sesiju modema, i "
"postavite vrijeme čuvara na kratki interval poput:"

#. Tag: screen
#: tricks.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><command>ATZ</command></userinput>\n"
"<userinput><command>ATS12=5</command></userinput>\n"
"<userinput><command>AT&amp;W</command></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput><command>ATZ</command></userinput>\n"
"<userinput><command>ATS12=5</command></userinput>\n"
"<userinput><command>AT&amp;W</command></userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Then use the <guilabel>Guard Time</guilabel> slider in the Modem commands "
"section to match the register (<varname>S12</varname> to this value "
"<returnvalue>5</returnvalue>. The modem should then hangup properly."
msgstr ""
"Zatim iskoristite <guilabel>Vrijeme čuvara</guilabel> klizač u sekciji "
"komande modema da sparite registar (<varname>S12</varname> sa njegovom "
"vrijednosti <returnvalue>5</returnvalue>. Modem bi tada trebao da se "
"pravilno odspoji."

#. Tag: title
#: tricks.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "How the Command Method Works"
msgstr "Kako Metoda komande radi"

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the local modem is connected to a remote modem, it is in the "
"<quote>connect</quote> state, where it passes all characters it receives to "
"the remote modem without interpretation. To have the modem accept the "
"characters as commands for itself, one must put the modem into the command "
"state. The escape code does this."
msgstr ""
"Kada je lokalni modem povezan sa daljinskim modemom, tada je on u stanju "
"<quote>spojen</quote>, te sve karaktere koje primi propušta daljinskom "
"modemu bez interpretacije. Kako bi modem primio karaktere kao komande za "
"sebe, mora biti stavljen u stanje komande. To radi izlazni kod."

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The escape code is defined as being three intervals of time whose length is "
"defined by <varname>S12</varname> in fiftieths of a second."
msgstr ""
"Izlazni kod je definisan kao tri intervala vremena čija je dužina definisana "
"<varname>S12</varname> u pedesetim dijelovima sekunde."

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:128 tricks.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quiet (must last more than <varname>S12</varname>/50 seconds)"
msgstr "Tiho (mora trajati duže od <varname>S12</varname>/50 sekundi)"

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Escape character (defined by the register <varname>S2</varname>, the default "
"is <quote>+</quote>), repeated three times (less than <varname>S12</"
"varname>/50 seconds between each."
msgstr ""
"Karakter za izlaz(definisan od strane registrar <varname>S2</varname>, "
"zadani je <quote>+</quote>), ponavljan tri puta(manje od <varname>S12</"
"varname>/50 sekundi između svakog."

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the modem is in the command state, you can send it commands. To have it "
"hang up, send the command <command>ATH</command>. The escape codes and the "
"hangup string used by &kppp; are shown in the <link linkend=\"modem-commands"
"\"><guilabel>Modem Commands</guilabel></link> dialog. These should match "
"your modem."
msgstr ""
"Jednom kada je modem u stanju komande, možete mu slati komande. Da bi se "
"odspojio, pošaljite mu komandu <command>ATH</command>. Kodovi za izlaz i "
"stringovi za odspajanje koje koristi &kppp; pokazani su u <link linkend="
"\"modem-commands\"><guilabel>Komande modema</guilabel></link> dijalogu. Ove "
"bi trebale odgovarati vašem modemu."

#. Tag: title
#: tricks.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "Make Tone dialing faster"
msgstr "Učini tonsko pozivanje bržim"

#. Tag: para
#: tricks.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you can use tone dialing, the amount of time it takes to dial can be "
"changed using the <varname>S11</varname> register. It gives the duration (in "
"100hundreds of a second) to send each tone while dialing. The default is "
"usually 95 (almost a second.) How fast you can dial depends on the phone "
"company's switching equipment which handles your line. The minimum duration "
"is 50, almost twice as fast, and that speed often works."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko želite koristiti tonsko pozivanje,  dužinu vremena koje je potrebno "
"za poziv možete promijeniti koristeći <varname>S11</varname> registar. Ono "
"nudi trajanje (u stotinjkama) slanja svakog tona tokom pozivanja. Zadana "
"vrijednost je obično 95 (skoro sekunda). Koliko brzo možete pozivati ovisi o "
"opremi kompanije telefona koji koristite. Minimalno trajanje je 50, skoro "
"duplo brže, i ta brzina obično radi."

#. Tag: screen
#: tricks.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><command>ATZ</command></userinput>        <lineannotation># reset "
"to default profile</lineannotation>\n"
"<userinput><command>ATS11=50</command></userinput>   <lineannotation># "
"fastest possible dialing, use a higher number if it doesn't work</"
"lineannotation>\n"
"<userinput><command>AT&amp;W</command></userinput>   <lineannotation># write "
"to default profile</lineannotation>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput><command>ATZ</command></userinput>        <lineannotation># "
"postavi na zadani profil</lineannotation>\n"
"<userinput><command>ATS11=50</command></userinput>   <lineannotation># "
"najbrže moguće pozivanje, koristite veći broj ukoliko ovaj ne radi</"
"lineannotation>\n"
"<userinput><command>AT&amp;W</command></userinput>   <lineannotation>#piši "
"zadanom profilu</lineannotation>"
